Z||000000||bHooper||02-17-2001||02:26 PM||||for the first time in what feels like a <B>very</B> long time, i am alone at home.  just me and two dogs.  no fiance', no "future in laws", no funerals to attend, no parents bothering me, no friends wanting me to do this or that, no nothing.  just me, the dogs and the GT.<P>so, what do i chose to do?  i decided this would be the perfect weekend to tackle that leaky forward exhaust manifold.  there's plenty of time to soak those bolts (every 45min-1 hour they get a squirt of PB Blaster), and in between i can dissasemble the console and finish that.<P>so, it's like living by myself again... trunk lid is laying in the living room, radio suround is in the kitchen and the black console support is laying in the den.<P>I'm having FUN!!!!!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>the only problem, is i'm about to run out of Locktite!<P>la de da de dum ... <P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT<BR>KYB's, Eibach's,<BR>Poly Bushings||||reg||1
